source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: Jira leaves the brackets visible in an error span and renders the trailing words as text, so jiro stays silent.
-- input.jira --
{{[x] foo}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt><span class="error">&#91;x&#93;</span> foo</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`[x] foo`
-- warnings.json --
[]
